WEBVTT

00:01:57.090 --> 00:02:02.100
and a few months later,
the marathon was born.

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:07.230
Organizing a marathon
as a reaction to an accident

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:10.140
may sound strange,

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:15.120
but at that time, even during
my most vulnerable condition,

00:02:15.130 --> 00:02:17.120
I needed to dream big.

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:20.110
I needed something
to take me out of my pain,

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:22.170
an objective to look forward to.

00:02:23.180 --> 00:02:28.040
I didn't want to pity myself,
nor to be pitied,

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:31.160
and I thought by organizing
such a marathon,